#. セレスさん…こんな所で何してるの？
msgctxt "0001 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid "Celeste... What are you doing here?"
msgstr ""

#. この倉庫はすごい所ですわね…
#. 色んな生活必需品が揃っておりますわ。
msgctxt "0002 | CELES"
msgid ""
"This warehouse is amazing. It has absolutely\n"
"everything one might need to live a full life."
msgstr ""

#. 食料品から、ジャージやタオル類まで…
#. より取り見取りですわね。
msgctxt "0003 | CELES"
msgid ""
"From food to clothes to towels... There's an endless\n"
"supply to choose from."
msgstr ""

#. そんな事よりさ…セレスさんは、
#. 事件に関する手掛かりは見つけた？
msgctxt "0004 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid ""
"I see that, but...have you found anything related to\n"
"the case?"
msgstr ""

#. …やはり、お聞きになるのですね。
msgctxt "0005 | CELES"
msgid "I knew you were going to ask me that."
msgstr ""

#. 倉庫の説明で誤魔化そうとしましたが…
#. 無駄でしたか。
msgctxt "0006 | CELES"
msgid ""
"I thought talking about the warehouse itself might\n"
"misdirect you, but I see it was pointless."
msgstr ""

#. …じゃあ、何か知ってるんだね？
msgctxt "0007 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid "Then you did find something?"
msgstr ""

#. では、“特別にあなただけ”に、
#. 教えてあげましょう。
msgctxt "0008 | CELES"
msgid "Very well. I will tell you, and *only* you."
msgstr ""

#. …わたくし、昨晩見かけたのです。
#. この倉庫で不二咲さんの姿を…
msgctxt "0009 | CELES"
msgid ""
"Last night, I saw her here... Chihiro was in the\n"
"warehouse."
msgstr ""

#. えっ…？　不二咲さんを！？
msgctxt "0010 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid "What? Really!?"
msgstr ""

#. あれは、夜時間になる直前の事でしたわ…
msgctxt "0011 | CELES"
msgid "This was right before nighttime."
msgstr ""

#. あら？　こんな時間にこんな場所で
#. 何をなさっているのですか？
msgctxt "0012 | CELES"
msgid "Hm? What are you doing out this late?"
msgstr ""

#. う、うん…ちょっと……
msgctxt "0013 | CHIHIRO FUJISAKI"
msgid "Oh, um...I was just..."
msgstr ""

#. トレーニングでも始めるおつもりですか？
msgctxt "0014 | CELES"
msgid "Are you planning to go exercise, perhaps?"
msgstr ""

#. えっ！？　なんで…わかったのぉ？
msgctxt "0015 | CHIHIRO FUJISAKI"
msgid "What!? H-How did you know...?"
msgstr ""

#. スポーツバッグから、はみ出していますわよ。
#. 青いジャージの袖が…
msgctxt "0016 | CELES"
msgid ""
"Because I can see a blue track jacket sticking out of\n"
"that duffel bag you're carrying..."
msgstr ""

#. ホントだ…ありがとう…
msgctxt "0017 | CHIHIRO FUJISAKI"
msgid "Oh, you're right... Thanks."
msgstr ""

#. じゃあ…急いでるから行くね…
msgctxt "0018 | CHIHIRO FUJISAKI"
msgid "Well...I'd better get going. I'm kind of in a hurry."
msgstr ""

#. ………………
msgctxt "0019 | CELES"
msgid "..."
msgstr "..."

#. 彼女は慌ててジャージをバッグにしまっていました。
#. まるで隠しているように…
msgctxt "0020 | CELES"
msgid ""
"She stuffed the jacket into her bag in a hurry. It was\n"
"almost like she was trying to hide it..."
msgstr ""

#. そして…そのまま出て行ってしまわれましたわ。
msgctxt "0021 | CELES"
msgid "And just like that, she was gone."
msgstr ""

#. わたくしは、てっきりトレーニングに行くのは
#. 翌朝だとばかり思っていたのですが…
msgctxt "0022 | CELES"
msgid ""
"I assumed she was merely stocking up to go exercise in\n"
"the morning, but..."
msgstr ""

#. どうやら、彼女は夜時間のルールを無視して、
#. その足でトレーニングに向かったようですわね。
msgctxt "0023 | CELES"
msgid ""
"...it would appear she ignored the nighttime rule, and\n"
"headed directly to the girls locker room."
msgstr ""

#. ルールを無視するから…こんな事になったのです…
msgctxt "0024 | CELES"
msgid ""
"If she hadn't broken our rule, none of this ever would\n"
"have happened..."
msgstr ""

#. 自業自得ですわね…
msgctxt "0025 | CELES"
msgid "You get what you deserve, I suppose."
msgstr ""

#. <CLT 4>じゃあ、不二咲さんはやっぱり…
#. <CLT>
msgctxt "0026 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid ""
"<CLT 4>So apparently...\n"
"<CLT>"
msgstr ""

#. <CLT 4><CLT><CLT 3>こっそりトレーニングする<CLT><CLT 4>為に女子更衣室に行った…
#. だから、わざわざ夜時間に…
#. <CLT>
msgctxt "0027 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid ""
"<CLT 4>...she went to the girls locker room late at night\n"
"in order to <CLT><CLT 3>exercise without anyone knowing<CLT><CLT 4>.\n"
"<CLT>"
msgstr ""

#. <CLT 4>あれ、だけど変だな…
#. <CLT>
msgctxt "0028 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid ""
"<CLT 4>But the strange thing is...\n"
"<CLT>"
msgstr ""

#. <CLT 4>あの現場には、セレスさんが見た、
#. <CLT><CLT 3>ジャージもバッグも残されてなかった<CLT><CLT 4>よな。
#. <CLT>
msgctxt "0029 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid ""
"<CLT 4>...there was no trace of the <CLT><CLT 3>track jacket or duffel\n"
"bag<CLT><CLT 4> Celeste said she saw Chihiro carrying.\n"
"<CLT>"
msgstr ""

#. <CLT 4>犯人が証拠隠滅したって事か…？
#. <CLT>
msgctxt "0030 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid ""
"<CLT 4>Which would mean the killer would have gotten rid of\n"
"it somehow...\n"
"<CLT>"
msgstr ""

#. <CLT 23><CLT><CLT 3>セレスの証言<CLT><CLT 23>を手帳に記録しました。
#. 言弾（コトダマ）メニューで確認できます。
#. <CLT>
msgctxt "0031 | NARRATION"
msgid ""
"<CLT 23>\"<CLT><CLT 3>Celeste's Account<CLT><CLT 23>\" has been added to the Truth\n"
"Bullets section of your handbook.\n"
"<CLT>"
msgstr ""

#. <CLT 4>始まる…学級裁判が…
#. <CLT>
msgctxt "0032 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid ""
"<CLT 4>Begin the class trial, or...?\n"
"<CLT>"
msgstr ""

#. 始まってしまうんだな…
msgctxt "0033 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid "It's about to begin."
msgstr ""

#. …わたくし、昨晩見かけたのです。
#. この倉庫で不二咲さんの姿を…
