msgid ""
"Last night, I saw her here... Chihiro was in the\n"
"warehouse."
msgstr ""

#. えっ…？　不二咲さんを！？
msgctxt "0035 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid "What? Really!?"
msgstr ""

#. あれは、夜時間になる直前の事でしたわ…
msgctxt "0036 | CELES"
msgid "This was right before nighttime."
msgstr ""

#. あら？　こんな時間にこんな場所で
#. 何をなさっているのですか？
