msgid ""
"<CLT 4>So apparently...\n"
"<CLT>"
msgstr ""

#. <CLT 4><CLT><CLT 3>こっそりトレーニングする<CLT><CLT 4>為に、女子更衣室に行った…
#. だから、わざわざ夜時間に…
#. <CLT>
msgctxt "0052 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid ""
"<CLT 4>Chihiro went to the girls locker room in the middle of\n"
"the night so she could <CLT><CLT 3>exercise in secret<CLT><CLT 4>...\n"
"<CLT>"
msgstr ""

#. <CLT 4>あれ、だけど変だな…
#. <CLT>
msgctxt "0053 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid ""
"<CLT 4>But the strange thing is...\n"
"<CLT>"
msgstr ""

#. <CLT 4>あの現場には、セレスさんが見た、
#. <CLT><CLT 3>ジャージもバッグも残されてなかった<CLT><CLT 4>よな。
#. <CLT>
msgctxt "0054 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid ""
"<CLT 4>...there was no trace of the <CLT><CLT 3>track jacket or duffel\n"
"bag<CLT><CLT 4> Celeste said she saw Chihiro carrying.\n"
"<CLT>"
msgstr ""

#. <CLT 4>犯人が証拠隠滅したって事か…？
#. <CLT>
msgctxt "0055 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid ""
"<CLT 4>Which would mean the killer would have gotten rid of\n"
"it somehow...\n"
"<CLT>"
msgstr ""

#. <CLT 4>モノクマが写るモニター…
#. 今は校章が浮かんでいるだけだ…
#. <CLT>
msgctxt "0056 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid ""
"<CLT 4>This is one of the monitors Monokuma appears on.\n"
"Right now, it's just showing the school crest.\n"
"<CLT>"
msgstr ""

#. <CLT 4>学級裁判はいつ始まるんだろう…
#. <CLT>
msgctxt "0057 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid ""
"<CLT 4>I wonder when the class trial's gonna start...\n"
"<CLT>"
msgstr ""

#. <CLT 4>監視カメラ…
#. <CLT>
msgctxt "0058 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid ""
"<CLT 4>A surveillance camera...\n"
"<CLT>"
msgstr ""

#. <CLT 4>黒幕は監視カメラで見ていたはずだ。
#. 不二咲さんが殺されたところも…
#. <CLT>
msgctxt "0059 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid ""
"<CLT 4>The mastermind must have been watching as Chihiro was\n"
"killed...\n"
"<CLT>"
msgstr ""

#. <CLT 4>黒幕はそれを知った上で…
#. ボクらにこんな事をさせているのか…！
#. <CLT>
msgctxt "0060 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid ""
"<CLT 4>They know what's happened, and they're still forcing\n"
"us to go through with this...!\n"
"<CLT>"
msgstr ""

#. <CLT 4>ここの棚には、食べ物が並んでいる…
#. <CLT>
msgctxt "0061 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid ""
"<CLT 4>There's all different kinds of food stacked up.\n"
"<CLT>"
msgstr ""

#. <CLT 4>特に気になる事はないな…
#. <CLT>
msgctxt "0062 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid ""
"<CLT 4>I don't see anything noteworthy...\n"
"<CLT>"
msgstr ""

#. <CLT 4>生活必需品がごちゃごちゃと置かれている…
#. <CLT>
msgctxt "0063 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid ""
"<CLT 4>There's all kinds of stuff piled up everywhere.\n"
"<CLT>"
msgstr ""

#. <CLT 4>特に気になる事はないな…
#. <CLT>
msgctxt "0064 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid ""
"<CLT 4>I don't see anything noteworthy...\n"
"<CLT>"
msgstr ""

#. <CLT 4>生活必需品がごちゃごちゃと置かれている…
#. <CLT>
msgctxt "0065 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid ""
"<CLT 4>There's all kinds of stuff piled up everywhere.\n"
"<CLT>"
msgstr ""

#. <CLT 4>タオルやジャージ…学校の備品みたいのも
#. 揃っているようだ。
#. <CLT>
msgctxt "0066 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid ""
"<CLT 4>Towels, jackets... Looks like they've put together a\n"
"good collection of school equipment.\n"
"<CLT>"
msgstr ""

#. <CLT 4>生活必需品がごちゃごちゃと置かれている…
#. <CLT>
msgctxt "0067 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid ""
"<CLT 4>There's all kinds of stuff piled up everywhere.\n"
"<CLT>"
msgstr ""

#. <CLT 4>タオルやジャージ…学校の備品みたいのも
#. 揃っているようだ。
#. <CLT>
msgctxt "0068 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid ""
"<CLT 4>Towels, jackets... Looks like they've put together a\n"
"good collection of school equipment.\n"
"<CLT>"
msgstr ""

#. <CLT 4>これは、冷蔵庫か…
#. <CLT>
msgctxt "0069 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid ""
"<CLT 4>Is this the fridge Sayaka mentioned?\n"
"<CLT>"
msgstr ""

#. <CLT 4>ここには、特に気になる事はないな…
#. <CLT>
msgctxt "0070 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid ""
"<CLT 4>I don't see anything noteworthy here...\n"
"<CLT>"
msgstr ""

#. はい
msgctxt "0071 | CHOICE/RE:ACT"
msgid "Yes"
msgstr ""

#. いいえ
msgctxt "0072 | CHOICE/RE:ACT"
msgid "No"
msgstr ""

#. <CLT 23>外に出ますか？
#. <CLT>
msgctxt "0073 | NARRATION"
msgid ""
"<CLT 23>Leave the area?\n"
"<CLT>"
msgstr ""
